{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118433","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118433/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118433/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118433/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118433","id":4246080145,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc79FgqR","number":118433,"title":"Basis::set_quaternion() divides by zero when quaternion length is zero","user":{"login":"rayamazaky","id":238893411,"node_id":"U_kgDODj05Yw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238893411?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky","html_url":"https://github.com/rayamazaky","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rayamazaky/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-12T00:21:56Z","updated_at":"2026-04-13T09:17:06Z","closed_at":"2026-04-13T09:16:38Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.7.dev (commit 1aabcb9e9b)\n\n### Issue description\n\n`Basis::set_quaternion()` in `core/math/basis.cpp` at line 831 divides by the quaternion's squared length without guarding against zero:\n\n```cpp\nvoid Basis::set_quaternion(const Quaternion &p_quaternion) {\n    real_t d = p_quaternion.length_squared();\n    real_t s = 2.0f / d;  // Division by zero if d == 0\n    real_t xs = p_quaternion.x * s, ys = p_quaternion.y * s, zs = p_quaternion.z * s;\n    ...\n}\n```\n\nIf `p_quaternion` is a zero quaternion (w=x=y=z=0), `d` will be 0, causing `s` to become infinity (or NaN with some floating-point modes). This produces a Basis filled with NaN values that silently propagate through all subsequent matrix operations (transforms, rendering, physics).\n\nNotably, other similar conversion functions in the codebase do guard against this. For example, `Quaternion(const Basis&)` at `quaternion.h:150` checks `Math::abs(d) > ALMOST_ONE` before dividing.\n\nAdditionally, the `Quaternion::operator Basis()` conversion path at `basis.cpp:739-741` has a similar unguarded division:\n```cpp\nreal_t s = Math::sqrt(m.rows[i][i] - m.rows[j][j] - m.rows[k][k] + 1.0f);\ntemp[i] = s * 0.5f;\ns = 0.5f / s;  // Division by zero if the sqrt result is 0\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a zero quaternion: `Quaternion(0, 0, 0, 0)`\n2. Construct a Basis from it: `Basis(q)` or call `basis.set_quaternion(q)`\n3. The resulting Basis contains NaN/infinity values.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A — straightforward math issue visible from code analysis.","closed_by":{"login":"rsubtil","id":6501975,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY1MDE5NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6501975?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil","html_url":"https://github.com/rsubtil","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rsubtil/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118433/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118433/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}